              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, to decide whether a statute is \u201cweighing\u201d or \u201cnon\u2011weighing,\u201d courts look to the function of an eligibility factor in the statute\u2019s sentence\u2011selection process."
